{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础架构篇","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kmp-architecture-overview","title":"KMP 架构与编译管线","url":"/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/foundations/kmp-architecture-overview","wordCount":1256,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"source-set-hierarchy","title":"源集层次与依赖关系","url":"/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/foundations/source-set-hierarchy","wordCount":1019,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"kotlin-native-memory-model","title":"Kotlin/Native 内存管理","url":"/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/foundations/kotlin-native-memory-model","wordCount":997,"readingTime":4}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础架构篇\n\n本章建立 Kotlin Multiplatform 的心智模型：编译管线如何将同一份 Kotlin 代码分别输出为 JVM 字节码和 LLVM 原生二进制；源集（Source Set）层次结构如何组织平台无关与平台特定代码；以及 Kotlin/Native 的现代内存管理器如何在无 JVM 的环境中提供安全的并发模型。\n\n掌握这三个维度后，你将具备在后续章节中设计共享逻辑、构建跨平台 UI 和搭建工程流水线的底层认知基础。\n"}